# Legacy sistemi DOĞRUDAN çağırma (normalde istemciler proxy'yi kullanır).
@legacy = http://localhost:5201
@ordNo = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###
GET {{legacy}}/api/products

###
GET {{legacy}}/api/customers

###
GET {{legacy}}/api/orders

###
GET {{legacy}}/api/orders/{{ordNo}}

### Legacy sözleşmesi: büyük harf, kısaltma alan adları
POST {{legacy}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CUST_ID": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "KALEMLER": [ { "PRD_ID": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "ADET": 2 } ]
}

###
POST {{legacy}}/api/orders/{{ordNo}}/ship

###
POST {{legacy}}/api/orders/{{ordNo}}/cancel
